---
// ヒーロー直下の信頼バッジ帯
---
<div class="trust-strip" aria-label="サービスの信頼性">
  <div class="sd-container trust-strip-inner">
    <div class="trust-strip-item">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
      <div>
        <div class="trust-strip-title">資格・許認可確認済み</div>
        <div class="trust-strip-sub">対応する法定資格を確認した業者のみ</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-strip-item">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
      <div>
        <div class="trust-strip-title">しつこい営業なし</div>
        <div class="trust-strip-sub">利用規約で営業行為を禁止</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-strip-item">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
      <div>
        <div class="trust-strip-title">利用は完全無料</div>
        <div class="trust-strip-sub">見積もり・紹介・契約後も0円</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-strip-item">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
      <div>
        <div class="trust-strip-title">最短当日ご紹介</div>
        <div class="trust-strip-sub">緊急案件にも対応</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
